      "plain": "Special Ammo Sword\nDrops with a random Sword Frame and Exotic Intrinsic. Impact Stat has no effect on perk damage. Frame exclusively determines Heavy Attack.\nBreaker Type is determined by Exotic Trait.\n\nKills grant an additional 2.5% Light Transcendent Energy and 2.5% Dark Transcendent Energy.\n\nWhile Transcendent:\n35% [20%] increased damage and +50 Charge Rate. Does not include +5% from Transcendence.\nExotic Intrinsic Effects (Wolfpack, Perfect Fifth, Arc Conductor, Unplanned Reprieve, etc) are instead granted 20% increased damage.\nDealing any Sword Damage triggers the increased Prismatic Grenade Regeneration Speed.\nExtends Transcendent duration by an additional ?% kill.\n\n↑Transcendent Steel:\n+3 [+1] Ammo upon scoring a Prismatic Grenade Hit. \nOnly triggers on certain hits, averaging 3 to 4 procs per Prismatic Grenade thrown.",
